+## Recon Evidence
+
+- Read: `Docs/Reports/CELESTIAL_MECHANICS_SPECIFICATION.md`
+- Audited: `EclipseGameplaySystem.cs`, `HectonCelestialEngine.cs`, `EcosystemDirector.cs`
